Description: LAMP stack manager for GNOME
 GTK4 application to manage Apache, MySQL, PHP-FPM and related
 services on a GNOME desktop environment.
 .
 Features include starting and stopping services, managing Apache
 virtual hosts, editing php.ini parameters, and viewing service logs.
